            "value": "<p>This entry is a one-file data package totaling 283.7 KB, containing a file in .sav format.<p><p>If you use this dataset, please cite: Hilverda, Femke; Vollmann, Manja; Scheepers, Renée A.; van Herpen, Sanne G. A.; Nieboer, Anna P. (2023). Dataset cross-sectional study; project “Online academic education because of the COVID-19 crisis: For whom does(n’t) it work and what factors can explain this?”. Erasmus University Rotterdam (EUR). Dataset. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.25397/eur.23276627\" target=\"_blank\">https://doi.org/10.25397/eur.23276627</a><p>"
